+# Authentication troubleshooting
+
+## Expired sessions
+
+If a session expires, sign in again before retrying the request. Do not copy a
+session token into a support ticket or chat message.
+
+## Repeated sign-in prompts
+
+1. Confirm that the browser accepts first-party cookies.
+2. Check that the device clock is accurate.
+3. Sign out, close the browser tab, and sign in again.
+
+If the issue continues, record the request ID shown on the error page and send
+that identifier to the support team. The request ID is safe to share; session
+tokens and authentication cookies are not.
